abstract: "A reusable analysis framework and writing style tool based on Irving Fisher's public methodology, including the Debt-Deflation Theory, Equation of Exchange (MV=PT), Fisher Equation (i=r+pi_e), Permanently High Plateau analysis, Fisher Separation Theorem, Intertemporal Choice Theory, and Index Number methodology. Designed to assist in analysis of deflation risk, monetary policy transmission, debt cycles, and interest rate pricing. This skill provides an economic analysis framework and writing style calibration, and does NOT claim to represent Irving Fisher personally or his unpublished views."
