notes: "Irving Fisher passed away on April 29, 1947. All public views included in this framework are from sources dated on or before that date. In Chinese-language contexts, Irving Fisher is commonly referred to as '大费雪' (Big Fisher) to distinguish him from Philip Fisher ('小费雪', Small Fisher), the growth stock investing pioneer."
